msgid "Older Releases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:13
#: 2266b7bde29244318de1f96b9e0ac9ec
msgid "Feb 02, 2016: Plane 3.5.0 released. Major Release including new Kalman Filter (EKF2), Parachute Support, QuadPlane Support, Support for 4 new Flight Boards *and lots more*. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-5-0-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:17
#: f84180ecc0bd424ebd6364512b254dab
msgid "Sept 24, 2015: Plane 3.4.0 released. Major Release including EKF by default, more sensors, better logging, tuning, calibration. Last release to support APM2.x. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-4-0-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:21
#: 0a74fb507d6e4549a94eaa7827dc214e
msgid "Sept 11, 2014: Plane 3.1.1 released. Mostly bug fixes. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-1-1-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:23
#: 3691139991dc47f3bf1fdf1f2a4408bb
msgid "Aug 25, 2014: Plane 3.1.0 released. Major release with many new features, including terrain following, laser rangefinder support, and Linux support. All details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-1-0-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:27
#: b4f8d0237fee462e9544da86c75c66a3
msgid "May 18, 2014: Plane 3.03 released. Bug fixes. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-0-3-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:29
#: 4c7272772a41472da78afcd216474c44
msgid "May 4, 2014: Plane 3.0.2 released. Fixed an important I2C bug and added autotune."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:30
#: 3b88d3479430442295b60bfcb29064d1
msgid "April 7, 2014: Plane 3.0 released. Huge number of new features, including Kalman filters, dual sensor support, RTK GPS and more. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-3-0-0-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:34
#: 537b800deabe458ca6faf5e47122a247
msgid "Jan 29, 2014: Plane 2.78 released. Bug fixes. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-plane-2-78-released>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:36
#: 16357c6115b24e199c34479efbc76531
msgid "Jan 20, 2014: Plane 2.77 released. Many new features and enhanced support for Pixhawk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:38
#: 764cb0b5f8b74dd4bd2cf055ca2851fd
msgid "November 5, 2013: Plane 2.76 released. Bug fixes and a few new features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:39
#: 34e7384934264d5d81fb4fd194802e3a
msgid "October 28, 2013: Plane 2.75 released. New features, performance improvements and bug fixes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:40
#: 3d98b2bc75ee4195b23fe8aa1923d7f7
msgid "July 15, 2013: Plane 2.74 released. Significant performance improvements. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/apm-plane-2-74-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:42
#: 4eb5281b90ab4a1d8f5508a22a3dbc2f
msgid "June 2013: Plane codebase renamed Plane to reflect support of multiple hardware platforms, including PX4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:44
#: 1bbc4ba0c26646739280c8ad284bcfd8
msgid "May 13, 2013: Plane 2.73 released. Bug fixes, GPS improvements and elevon performance enhancements. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-73-released?xg_source=activity>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:47
#: 3d7f970b088a45af9c0412e9c7d04a6d
msgid "April 28, 2013: Plane 2.72 released. Significant navigation improvements as well as other performance enhancements and bug fixes. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-72-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:51
#: b41fddc414894da180e2fc2f0ab39e29
msgid "April 5, 2013: Plane 2.71 released. Performance improvements, bug fixes and new MAVLink features. See details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-71-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:54
#: 85ebcafea55744a6a71c60145b6aeac1
msgid "Feb 20, 2013: Plane 2.70 released. Bug fixes, performance improvements and a few new features including improved digicam control. More details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-70-released>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:58
#: a8e74e1db7914534afbe30c7c3290bf8
msgid "Feb 10, 2013: Plane 2.69 released. Includes new Training mode, support for PX4 board, and improved performance. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-69-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:61
#: b206a8858adf42ac96d54b2e2d912942
msgid "Dec 3, 2012: Plane 2.68 released. Bug fixes and much improved sensor/DCM processing for improved performance. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-68-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:64
#: 2aeb20add930427eb57f5847dc2005fc
msgid "Nov 21, 2012: Plane 2.67 released. Bug fixes and new features. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-67-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:67
#: 955d50f07cfe4f1bb4f1904616a4e762
msgid "Oct 30th, 2012: Plane 2.66 released. Bug fixes and feature additions. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-66-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:70
#: 2e851a2481ba49e2a3579a5d888711cc
msgid "Sept 23, 2012: Plane 2.64/2.65 release. Bug fixes. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-65-released>`__ and `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-64-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:74
#: 7cac53435e56470182334ce282333d05
msgid "Sept 17, 2012: Plane 2.63 released. Minor bug fixes, including one that had caused resets if a GPS was not connected. Details `here <http://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-63-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:77
#: 16b37cc75e0f4024a87644653da911c3
msgid "Sept 12, 2012: Plane 2.62 released. Minor bug fixes and performance improvements. Details `here <http://www.diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-62-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:80
#: c60d8dba93cf4cf580d566b10f5ec75e
msgid "Sept 9. 2012: Plane 2.61 released. Bug fixes and performance enhancements, which are all described `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-61-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:83
#: 057a051af39540f096458ebc56986304
msgid "August 22, 2012: Plane 2.60 released. Bug fixes (including one on the dataflash erasing) and performance improvements. Main new features in this release are: wind estimation; long term dead reckoning support; wheeled takeoff and landing support; optional new roll/pitch/yaw controllers. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-60-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:89
#: 7d2518d80a5d43e6a7650819ab7b0374
msgid "July 25, 2012: Plane 2.50 released. Improvement include improved DCM performance, waypoint logic and altitude control. Bug fixes include dataflash erasing, some missing MAVLink parameters and navigation roll control. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-50-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:94
#: a61d22ea74974fd5a98b4d66f9306922
msgid "June 15, 2012: Plane 2.40 released. Supports MAVLink 1.0, new 3DR Ublox GPS module, improved dataflash erase to ensure fast startup on first use, fixed an elevon reverse bug in the setup process. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-40-beta>`__ and `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-40-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:100
#: 6e99e08e144d44aea60c28933c13dc51
msgid "May 13, 2012: Plane 2.34 released. Fixes a bug that affected some APM 2 boards with a slightly rev of the MPU-6000 sensor. Adds support for MAVLink 1.0. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-34-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:104
#: 057d0bfd718343129296f50400b1134e
msgid "April 9, 2012: Plane 2.33 released. Compass declination can now be set automatically. Includes MAVLink improvements optimized for new 3DR radios."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:107
#: 9425ed0d2cd64a028a5ac36ea48770e1
msgid "March 28, 2012: Plane 2.32 released. Includes some compass and baro sensor improvements. Full description `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-32-released?>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:110
#: bd08e38bbeb34e9bbf7219232d6de12a
msgid "March 17, 2012: Plane 2.30 released. Much improved DCM and compass code for better stability and navigation performance. Many other bug fixes. Full description in the release post `here <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/arduplane-2-30-released>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:114
#: 3f1be2699476460d9a67b0dada521238
msgid "Jan 16, 2012: Plane 2.28 released. Improved compatibility with APM 2, including support for airspeed and battery-monitoring sensors. Some bug fixes on compass and datalogging."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:117
#: cdeee61da8e24d52b763ee7e2d71305a
msgid "Dec 20, 2011: Plane 2.27 released. Adds geofencing function, improved datalogging and filesystem, faster MAVLink starts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:119
#: fef45f5bcc15421285fd7b20392b41a7
msgid "Nov 19, 2011: Plane 2.26 released. Log files will now overwrite from the beginning of the memory when the dataflash is full (before, logging would halt when memory was full until you manually cleared the logs)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:123
#: dfa19349343d4982af75cf67e0169cdd
msgid "Nov 13, 2011: Plane 2.25 released. Bug fixes, plus changes to mission structure so that conditional and immediate commands are located between associated waypoints instead of after the second waypoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:126
#: f605fcf84cdf49aa8d1d61cd262609cc
msgid "Sept 8, 2011: Plane 2.24 released. Mostly bug fixes, including fixes to avoid memory overruns and EEPROM corruption. Also includes a few new features, including improved MAVline comms, improves Crosstrack correction, code to avoid Xbee bricking, improved use of the temperature sensor in barometric sensor reading, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:131
#: 477cbf2cf1da46008810c51c6aa31d1a
msgid "August 25, 2011: Plane 2.23 released. Includes differential aileron/flap functionality. Corrected AIRSPD2PTCH_IMAX Mavlink parameter to work in GCSs. Fixed condition_change_alt command to handle decents properly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:135
#: 0a014227d47d40109a67af01170b985c
msgid "August 15, 2011: APM 2.22 released. Many small improvements, including: MAVLink startup is now much faster and will work even if the hardware fails the calibration test. 5883 magnetometer bug fixed. Various (mostly minor) navigation bugs fixed. MAVLink comms improved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:139
#: 024d3b52eaa94eea9c1a74017ef15a0d
msgid "July 3, 2011: APM 2.20 released. Now supports the new `standard magnetometer using the HMC5883L chip <http://store.jdrones.com/APM2_6_Compass_HMC5883_p/jdmagnet001.htm>`__, which is autodetected. Also fixes problem with airspeed sensor autodetection in some setups. For now, to enable your airspeed sensor via the Mission Planner Configuration screen. Change the AIRSPD_ENABLE value to 1 to enable, then click \"Write PIDs\" to save. You can check that it's enabled correctly with the CLI Test \"airspeed\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:146
#: c7ea33dbd3414fcc935659e14b1b2bcd
msgid "June 9, 2011: Gorgeous new Mission Planner version (1.0) released, with a new Guided mode for real time \"go here now\" commands. Details `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/introducing-a-new-apm-feature>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:149
#: ef0e99aafe2d44f19108247e5646018c
msgid "May 2, 2011: APM 2.1 is released, which takes the 2.x project out of beta. Release details are `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-2-out-of-beta>`__. The manual, Mission Planner and HK GCS have all been updated for APM 2.x."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:153
#: 766c6e68fee14e008091c255909405c6
msgid "March 11, 2011; First APM 2.x beta released. This is a major update, including MAVLink-based telemetry, mission planning and two-way communications. Details in the announcement post `here <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/apm-20-beta-released>`__."
msgstr ""
